From 01e1677c6165190878f9ff9e0fb802d5ed59698d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:18:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/39] um/arm64: fastpath: page-align the slot search window

vm_unmapped_area() returns low_limit unchanged when the gap starts there, and
low_limit was site - FP_RANGE, so for any site above 120 MiB the slot page
address was unaligned and vm_mmap() refused it: the fast path never engaged
for dynamically linked programs (only for static ones low in the address
space). Python os.getpid 2.23 -> 0.96 us, pipe write+read 4.9 -> 2.3 us on
an S24. fastpath=2 logs every patch attempt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B3kysVLGNgK27oVbqXzFEn
---
