+ * A guest fault on a page whose PTE is in sync and allowed the access all
+ * along: the host does not have mapped what we think. That is how a stub
+ * cloned at fork() looks if reclaim got to the parent's PTE between its copy
+ * and the clone. Have the page mapped again.
