+/*
+ * Time for the vDSO (vgettimeofday.c). The guest can only compute the time by
+ * itself from something it can read, and the one clock a host process reads
+ * without a syscall is the architected counter. So that is the clocksource,
+ * in place of the host's clock_gettime(), and what the timekeeper derives
